load @term/seed/code/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A parabola: the conic of points equidistant from a focus and a directrix, the curve of a thrown stone and of y equal
# to x squared. It is the borderline conic between the ellipse and the hyperbola, the shape that reflects parallel rays
# to a single point. The form carries the plane it lives in.
form parabola
  link plane, like vector-space
